### 1. Create a Shortened URL
POST http://localhost:8080/urls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "original_url": "https://example.com/very/long/path"
}

###

### 2. List All URLs for a User
GET http://localhost:8080/urls?user_id=1

###

### 3. Resolve / Redirect Short URL 
# (Replace 'abc123' with an actual short_key returned from your POST request)
GET http://localhost:8080/urls/qfrg7AmA

###

### 4. Delete a Short URL
# (Replace 'abc123' with the short code you want to delete)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/urls/tfRp5rGJ?user_id=1